		(libpart
			(lib "dcdc")
			(part "L_CELL")
			(description "OFF-BOARD CUSTOM power inductor rev M2 (sim/out/magnetics/design_pv_inductor.json; winding-house sheet sim/out/magnetics/spec_pv_inductor.md; electrical requirement sim/out/pv_design/cell_spec.json): 2 x POCO NPC290026 (NPC 26, 74/45/35 mm) stacked toroid (as M1), 37 turns of solid round enamelled Cu 3.15 mm grade 2, 1 layer, core wrapped 2 x 0.13 mm Nomex 410 + polyimide, VPI class H, NTC at the bore-side winding centre in a reinforced pocket; insulating base with a centre clamp in the cell air stream. L0 244 uH +/-8 %, 226 uH nom / 208 uH min at 45 A (>= 207.8 uH required), L(trip 72.4 A)/L0 0.81; ripple 34.6 App at 32 kHz; R_dc 22.2 mOhm at 110 C; loss 25.4 W core + 58.3 W copper (45 A); hot spot 145 C (<= 155 C); 1.74 kg. Embedded NTC 10 k 2 % B25/100 3988 K (R/T 8016). INSULATION (IC-16): winding-core basic: core wrapped 2 x 0.13 mm Nomex 410 + 1 x 0.05 mm polyimide over the epoxy coating (coating not counted), grade-2 enamel (not counted as insulation), VPI class H varnish (no air at the core edges); NTC in a reinforced pocket (3 layers polyimide + silicone sleeve) at the inner-side winding centre. Winding-core BASIC (U_rp 1273 V): PD <= 10 pC at 1910 Vpk (extinction >= 1528 Vpk), AC 2200 Vrms, impulse 6000 V; NTC-winding REINFORCED: PD <= 10 pC at 2387 Vpk, AC 4400 Vrms, impulse 8000 V. Routine: PD-free (<= 10 pC) at 1910 V pk winding-core; AC 2200 V rms 1 s; NTC-winding AC 4400 V rms 1 s. Type: AC 2200 V rms 1 min winding-core, 4400 V rms NTC-winding, impulse 6 kV / 8 kV; L(I) to 72.4 A; thermal run at 83.8 W (worst-point loss of this revision) in 150 m3/h. Core and clamp bonded to PE. LEAD A (through the LA 150-P on the cell board): flexible insulated lead, SUPPLEMENTARY insulation for 1000 V DC working, type-tested to the basic levels above, <= 10 mm outer size for the 13.5 x 10 mm aperture, <= 100 C there; copper screen over the aperture length, pigtail to PE (pin SCR)")
			(fields
				(field
					(name "Reference") "L")
				(field
					(name "Value") "L_CELL")
				(field
					(name "Footprint")
				)
				(field
					(name "Datasheet")
				)
				(field
					(name "Description") "OFF-BOARD CUSTOM power inductor rev M2 (sim/out/magnetics/design_pv_inductor.json; winding-house sheet sim/out/magnetics/spec_pv_inductor.md; electrical requirement sim/out/pv_design/cell_spec.json): 2 x POCO NPC290026 (NPC 26, 74/45/35 mm) stacked toroid (as M1), 37 turns of solid round enamelled Cu 3.15 mm grade 2, 1 layer, core wrapped 2 x 0.13 mm Nomex 410 + polyimide, VPI class H, NTC at the bore-side winding centre in a reinforced pocket; insulating base with a centre clamp in the cell air stream. L0 244 uH +/-8 %, 226 uH nom / 208 uH min at 45 A (>= 207.8 uH required), L(trip 72.4 A)/L0 0.81; ripple 34.6 App at 32 kHz; R_dc 22.2 mOhm at 110 C; loss 25.4 W core + 58.3 W copper (45 A); hot spot 145 C (<= 155 C); 1.74 kg. Embedded NTC 10 k 2 % B25/100 3988 K (R/T 8016). INSULATION (IC-16): winding-core basic: core wrapped 2 x 0.13 mm Nomex 410 + 1 x 0.05 mm polyimide over the epoxy coating (coating not counted), grade-2 enamel (not counted as insulation), VPI class H varnish (no air at the core edges); NTC in a reinforced pocket (3 layers polyimide + silicone sleeve) at the inner-side winding centre. Winding-core BASIC (U_rp 1273 V): PD <= 10 pC at 1910 Vpk (extinction >= 1528 Vpk), AC 2200 Vrms, impulse 6000 V; NTC-winding REINFORCED: PD <= 10 pC at 2387 Vpk, AC 4400 Vrms, impulse 8000 V. Routine: PD-free (<= 10 pC) at 1910 V pk winding-core; AC 2200 V rms 1 s; NTC-winding AC 4400 V rms 1 s. Type: AC 2200 V rms 1 min winding-core, 4400 V rms NTC-winding, impulse 6 kV / 8 kV; L(I) to 72.4 A; thermal run at 83.8 W (worst-point loss of this revision) in 150 m3/h. Core and clamp bonded to PE. LEAD A (through the LA 150-P on the cell board): flexible insulated lead, SUPPLEMENTARY insulation for 1000 V DC working, type-tested to the basic levels above, <= 10 mm outer size for the 13.5 x 10 mm aperture, <= 100 C there; copper screen over the aperture length, pigtail to PE (pin SCR)")
			)
			(pins
